        {
          "text": "nimahina akukudi kaŋakuchipaŋu, niyishimi yachu, nimayandachu, niihina dakukudika leuchisu chakuchipaŋu, ninyonji yachu, nimpopu jachu, niyuma yejima yamudimu watabanaka, yetenti dakubulakena; ",
