        },
        {
          "text": "niyumayakuvwala yakutuŋa chachiwahi yakukalakala nachu mwajila, niyumayakuvwala yajila yakapristu Aroni, niyuma yakuvwala yawanyanindi, yakukalakala nachu mudimu wawupristu. ",
